WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:33.360
Yu Yuan, let her enter.

01:44.120 --> 01:46.800
It seems that I underestimated
your capabilities, Ms. Ji.

01:47.360 --> 01:49.960
Ever since I was cornered by Mrs. Hua
at Lei Zu Festival,

01:50.040 --> 01:52.400
I have learned
to prepare for the unexpected.

01:53.160 --> 01:56.160
I now make two plans
for every critical matter.

01:56.240 --> 01:57.560
Preparedness ensures no regrets.

01:58.080 --> 02:02.240
You used your authority to pressure others
and have Chief Sang work for you.

02:02.320 --> 02:06.200
Naturally, I used greater influence
to suppress Chief Sang's actions.

02:07.720 --> 02:10.160
Last time, it was Sang Shisi.

02:10.240 --> 02:12.440
This time, it's the Emperor himself.

02:13.480 --> 02:15.560
Ms. Ji,
you are using influence to suppress others

02:15.640 --> 02:17.440
and leveraging power against power.

02:17.520 --> 02:19.600
Is that not what I have also done?

02:19.680 --> 02:21.200
Not exactly.

02:21.280 --> 02:23.560
I never had the intent to harm others.

02:24.600 --> 02:28.480
A good person refraining from evil deeds
is not necessarily kind.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.800
Sometimes, it is merely because
they lack the ability.

02:30.880 --> 02:34.520
Even without the flower cookies,
I still managed to produce Flushed Rose.

02:34.600 --> 02:36.520
Do you want to know why?

02:39.520 --> 02:40.760
Yaoting, Mother,

02:40.840 --> 02:42.920
remember to stock up on flower cookies
and other ingredients.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.560
Flushed Rose requires
a large amount of them.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.280
The letter you sent to your family?

02:49.760 --> 02:52.760
Were you already planning to trap me?

02:52.840 --> 02:55.360
At first, I just wanted to try.

02:55.880 --> 02:57.320
Who would have thought
that you would take the bait

02:57.400 --> 02:59.600
and buy all the flower cookies
on the market?

03:00.200 --> 03:02.720
Replacing flower cookies with madder

03:02.800 --> 03:05.440
was a technique I developed long ago
while researching Flushed Rose.

03:06.520 --> 03:09.200
So what if you tricked me?

03:10.280 --> 03:12.120
All the flower cookies were bought up,

03:12.200 --> 03:14.360
but no one knows
that it was done by the Niu family.

03:15.320 --> 03:18.800
As for the money spent,
it was hardly worth mentioning.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.760
But you lost.

03:23.280 --> 03:26.560
Ms. Niu, I do not think that you have ever
experienced the taste of defeat, have you?

03:40.480 --> 03:41.680
Lost?

03:42.680 --> 03:46.880
Ms. Ji, you overestimate yourself.

03:48.120 --> 03:50.840
If you are careless,

03:50.920 --> 03:52.120
the registration document
and flower cookies

03:52.200 --> 03:54.400
could suppress you completely.

03:55.000 --> 03:57.880
But to me,
it was nothing more than a minor effort.

03:59.240 --> 04:02.640
Besides, I have already achieved my goal.

04:07.280 --> 04:11.360
Please take a look
at my wedding invitation, Ms. Ji.

04:33.960 --> 04:36.000
THE BRIDE, NIU WUNIANG
THE GROOM, ZHAO XIUYUAN

04:42.720 --> 04:45.560
Ms. Niu, you certainly know
how to put on a show.

04:46.080 --> 04:47.880
Do you think that I would believe this?

04:47.960 --> 04:52.760
If you do not believe it,
why do you look so pale, Ms. Ji?

04:55.280 --> 04:58.400
Why not ask Mr. Zhao yourself?

04:58.480 --> 05:00.480
You will see

05:01.080 --> 05:03.880
if I am lying.

05:12.240 --> 05:19.200
SONGXIAN BRIDGE

06:01.560 --> 06:05.120
Niu Wuniang told me
that you are getting married.

06:06.720 --> 06:08.400
I want to hear it from you.

06:09.320 --> 06:12.000
Is that true or not?

06:16.720 --> 06:18.320
The wedding is set
for the end of the month.

06:23.920 --> 06:24.760
Why?

06:30.400 --> 06:32.280
Niu Wuniang fell in love with me
at first sight.

06:33.520 --> 06:36.920
When my grandfather found out,
he proposed the match to the Niu family.

06:38.440 --> 06:41.440
That is not what I want to hear.
I want to hear your reason.

06:41.520 --> 06:42.600
Why?

06:43.600 --> 06:45.880
But if you go back on your word

06:45.960 --> 06:47.800
and try to be with her again,

06:48.600 --> 06:51.080
I will not show mercy.

06:55.080 --> 06:56.080
Why?

07:04.120 --> 07:05.760
That day, I went to see you

07:06.800 --> 07:08.680
because I knew she had imprisoned you.

07:10.880 --> 07:11.880
You knew?

07:12.480 --> 07:13.480
Yes.

07:15.880 --> 07:17.760
But there was nothing I could do.

07:20.720 --> 07:22.600
So, you are marrying Niu Wuniang

07:23.400 --> 07:25.200
because you fear she will hurt me?

07:27.800 --> 07:29.720
I know she will not spare me.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.880
But I am also not someone
who will accept my fate just like that.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.560
A cornered beast fights the hardest.

07:39.640 --> 07:41.520
Do you not find it entertaining, Mr. Zhao?

07:43.040 --> 07:44.240
Let me go!

07:47.240 --> 07:48.720
I am marrying Niu Wuniang

07:50.680 --> 07:52.680
because I have realized

07:53.680 --> 07:55.200
how important power truly is.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.120
But you have never cared about power.

07:58.200 --> 07:59.720
That was the old me.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.160
Not the man I am now.

08:06.000 --> 08:09.720
When I marry Niu Wuniang,
I will become Niu Jin's son-in-law.

08:10.640 --> 08:14.280
Marrying her will make me
the new Brocade Master

08:15.000 --> 08:16.760
and the next patriarch of the Zhao family.

08:21.120 --> 08:24.560
Who could resist such temptation?

08:26.160 --> 08:27.320
I do not believe it.

08:29.120 --> 08:32.080
We have known each other for over a decade
and spent all those years together.

08:32.159 --> 08:34.039
I know exactly
what kind of person you are.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.720
You cannot fool me.

08:38.520 --> 08:40.039
Is she threatening you as well?

08:40.760 --> 08:43.159
We have faced many trials together.

08:43.240 --> 08:45.400
We will get through this one too.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.440
I wanted them dead.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.680
And so, they died.

08:50.760 --> 08:51.840
GREAT VIRTUE CARRIES ALL THINGS

08:59.600 --> 09:01.120
She did threaten me.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.440
But giving up on you…

09:06.000 --> 09:07.680
This is my own choice.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.600
Do not give up.

09:15.240 --> 09:19.400
We have worked hard for so long
to finally be together.

09:19.480 --> 09:20.440
Do not give up now.

09:21.080 --> 09:24.120
Why give up so easily? No…

09:24.960 --> 09:26.320
Ji Yingying…

09:28.080 --> 09:31.600
Perhaps our love
is not as important as you think it is.

09:33.280 --> 09:35.640
You are strong. You are competitive.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.520
Maybe the reason
you do not want to give up

09:38.600 --> 09:42.360
is simply because you have never lost
even once in your life.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.440
Say that again.

09:57.720 --> 10:01.120
I, Zhao Xiuyuan,
am not as noble as you imagine.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.200
What makes you so sure

10:04.280 --> 10:07.520
that I will not feel jealous
if I saw you with Yang Jinglan?

10:10.760 --> 10:11.960
Is it not perfect now?

10:13.320 --> 10:16.080
I have left space for you and him to live
your quiet, peaceful days together.

10:17.080 --> 10:17.960
Enough!

10:19.440 --> 10:21.040
This is not just insulting me.

10:21.120 --> 10:23.520
You are insulting the love
we shared as well!

10:30.080 --> 10:31.200
Zhao Xiuyuan,

10:32.640 --> 10:34.040
it was you who gave up on me.

10:34.120 --> 10:36.560
Do not use such despicable excuses!

10:39.640 --> 10:40.880
WANGUAN

10:57.600 --> 11:00.360
Yingying, I know you will be sad.

11:01.480 --> 11:03.000
But under the weight of power,

11:03.080 --> 11:05.160
this is the only way I can protect you.

11:06.800 --> 11:08.160
Give me some time.

11:09.080 --> 11:12.240
One day,
I will hold true power in my hands.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.680
And then, no one will ever hurt you again.

11:16.200 --> 11:17.800
Not even me.

11:28.560 --> 11:30.080
What do we do about this?

11:35.240 --> 11:36.240
What do you mean?

11:37.800 --> 11:39.560
This is outrageous!

11:40.800 --> 11:43.000
I want to kill that Zhao scoundrel
right now!

11:43.080 --> 11:45.040
I am coming with you!
I have been waiting to punch him for ages!

11:45.120 --> 11:46.360
- Let's go!
- Sure!

11:47.560 --> 11:49.240
Do not be impulsive!

11:52.240 --> 11:54.280
If this could have made Yingying happy,

11:54.360 --> 11:56.200
I would have burned down
the Zhao residence a long time ago.

11:57.040 --> 11:59.840
But doing that
will only make her more upset.

12:00.760 --> 12:02.080
I cannot drink anymore.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.000
- Continue if you wish. I am done.
- Yuniang!

12:05.240 --> 12:06.160
I…

12:08.640 --> 12:09.600
What are you doing?

12:11.840 --> 12:13.760
- Yingying!
- Look at how you plate this dish.

12:13.840 --> 12:15.320
We have been looking for you.

12:15.400 --> 12:17.040
The dishes are incomplete.

12:17.120 --> 12:18.400
- The moon… It is beautiful tonight.
- Indeed.

12:19.760 --> 12:21.120
Have a seat.

12:24.480 --> 12:26.080
Why have you not started eating?

12:26.160 --> 12:28.840
Did we not agree that you would begin?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.120
Is it because the food is not good?

12:31.200 --> 12:32.760
Or is it that our wine
is not up to your standards?

12:33.360 --> 12:34.760
- No…!
- No…!

12:34.840 --> 12:36.080
- It is all perfect!
- So many delicious dishes!

12:36.160 --> 12:38.120
Come, come! The wine is here!

12:38.200 --> 12:40.120
Ting, hurry up and pour some for everyone!

12:41.560 --> 12:43.360
Today, the Ji family
survived a great calamity.

12:43.440 --> 12:45.160
We will celebrate together tonight!

12:45.240 --> 12:47.080
That is right!
We will not stop until we are drunk!

12:48.760 --> 12:49.760
Pour the wine!

12:49.840 --> 12:51.560
- Sure! Pour it!
- Pour it…!

12:51.640 --> 12:52.480
I am pouring…!

12:56.520 --> 12:57.560
Here.

13:16.520 --> 13:19.360
Tonight's gathering is a celebration.

13:20.000 --> 13:22.160
Nothing else matters.

13:22.680 --> 13:23.640
Do not worry.

13:23.720 --> 13:26.040
I am fine. You do not have to worry.

13:26.720 --> 13:29.080
However,
I have kept you all waiting today.

13:29.160 --> 13:31.000
So, I will start by drinking three bowls.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.040
This is the first bowl.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.600
What a good wine, Mother!

13:45.480 --> 13:46.680
This is the second bowl.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.040
That is enough, Yingying. Enough.

14:09.560 --> 14:12.000
Next, I offer three toasts.

14:18.400 --> 14:21.760
The first is for Mother and Yaoting.

14:22.800 --> 14:27.120
Thank you
for your unwavering support and care.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.120
I know I have made you worry.

14:53.120 --> 14:55.560
The second is for Bloom Society!

14:55.640 --> 14:56.480
Here!

15:01.000 --> 15:04.000
Without the trust and protection
from all of you,

15:04.600 --> 15:07.280
we would not have achieved success today.

15:07.360 --> 15:09.280
- Here is to everyone!
- Do not say that.

15:09.800 --> 15:12.280
Without you, we would not be here today.

15:12.360 --> 15:13.760
- Am I right?
- That is right!

15:13.840 --> 15:15.840
My butt has been through hell,

15:15.920 --> 15:19.000
but what happened was truly exciting.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.520
That is a story that I will be telling
for the rest of my life!

15:28.120 --> 15:29.600
I did not know
that was something to brag about.

15:30.840 --> 15:32.920
Telling others
about his butt going through hell.

15:33.000 --> 15:35.280
- We will do the same.
- Come on. Let us drink.

15:42.640 --> 15:44.200
That is enough, Yingying.
You need to slow down.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.520
Just one more.

15:53.880 --> 15:56.440
I want to toast my dear Yu.

15:58.640 --> 16:01.800
Thank you for braving the storm
to save me when I needed you.

16:02.880 --> 16:04.720
But do not forget to pay back
the money you owe me!

16:18.440 --> 16:20.440
This wine is pretty strong, Mother!

16:23.680 --> 16:26.000
What is wrong with you guys?
Why are you not eating?

16:26.080 --> 16:27.920
Is something wrong with the food?

16:28.000 --> 16:30.360
Or with the wine?

16:30.440 --> 16:31.560
- Come on.
- Smells delicious!

16:31.640 --> 16:32.560
- Everyone, let us eat!
- The wine is great!

16:32.640 --> 16:33.200
Time to eat.

16:33.280 --> 16:34.440
- Yes.
- Let us eat.

16:34.520 --> 16:35.720
- Come, eat!
- Come on. Let us get some food!

16:35.800 --> 16:37.120
- Here! I want some wine!
- Pour me a glass!

16:37.200 --> 16:38.560
We are not calling it a night
until we are drunk!

16:38.640 --> 16:40.000
Yes. Let us get drunk!

16:40.520 --> 16:41.520
Yes!

16:41.600 --> 16:42.720
- Slow down, will you?
- Here.

16:43.640 --> 16:44.600
Mother, join us.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.520
Everyone!

16:46.600 --> 16:47.440
Let us get drunk tonight!

16:47.520 --> 16:49.680
- Let us get drunk!
- Yes, time to drink!

17:02.040 --> 17:05.119
Once I adjust
the fit of this wedding outfit,

17:05.200 --> 17:07.720
I promise
you will look dashing and radiant

17:07.800 --> 17:10.160
when you meet your bride!

17:16.800 --> 17:18.400
You can use the kite.

17:18.480 --> 17:21.200
It will fly as far as you want it to.

17:24.800 --> 17:25.839
Zhao Xiuyuan,

17:27.240 --> 17:28.880
it was you who gave up on me.

17:28.960 --> 17:31.120
Do not use such despicable excuses!

17:35.640 --> 17:38.040
WANGUAN

17:38.120 --> 17:40.480
Do you know why I am giving this to you?

17:41.880 --> 17:43.320
It is because you do not lack wisdom.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.680
You are already brimming
with creative ideas

17:44.760 --> 17:46.000
and destined for greatness.

17:46.680 --> 17:48.960
You lack neither resources
nor financial stability.

17:49.040 --> 17:51.280
It is because
you have always sought the highs and lows,

17:52.200 --> 17:53.520
leaving no room for oversight.

18:03.120 --> 18:06.840
I am marrying Niu Wuniang
because I realize

18:07.800 --> 18:09.720
how important power truly is.

18:22.800 --> 18:25.320
My head hurts. I need some medicine!

18:25.400 --> 18:27.080
I think only spells will help.

18:29.840 --> 18:32.480
As expected,
only you know how to please me.

19:29.400 --> 19:30.400
Yingying,

19:32.440 --> 19:34.120
do you know why

19:34.880 --> 19:37.400
I married your father back then?

19:41.280 --> 19:42.760
Your father only cares

19:43.920 --> 19:45.640
about making brocade

19:46.440 --> 19:48.680
and spends all his time
in the embroidery room.

19:50.280 --> 19:53.200
He may not seem romantic,

19:53.800 --> 19:56.520
gentle, or considerate,

19:57.760 --> 20:01.760
but he would give up everything for me.

20:03.400 --> 20:06.480
When figuring out if a man loves you

20:07.000 --> 20:08.760
and is worthy of your trust,

20:09.480 --> 20:12.040
it is not just about
how he treats you day-to-day,

20:12.920 --> 20:16.680
but how he acts when faced with adversity.

20:19.760 --> 20:21.160
If a man

20:21.800 --> 20:25.560
chooses to abandon you
for power or gain now,

20:26.600 --> 20:31.920
he will abandon you
again and again in the future.

20:32.960 --> 20:36.160
Losing someone like him
is not a bad thing.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.600
You really do not need

20:38.680 --> 20:41.560
to feel sad or upset
over someone like him.

20:56.640 --> 20:57.880
Cry,

20:59.320 --> 21:00.200
silly girl.

21:03.560 --> 21:04.800
If you need to cry,

21:06.120 --> 21:08.520
just let it out.

21:09.920 --> 21:11.320
Once you are done,

21:11.920 --> 21:13.960
forget those who do not deserve your tears

21:15.000 --> 21:16.640
and focus on living a better life,

21:17.400 --> 21:18.360
okay?

21:53.000 --> 21:56.440
BROCADE BUREAU

22:19.600 --> 22:21.000
Based on your condition,

22:21.520 --> 22:23.200
it seems that you have been here
the whole night yesterday.

22:31.920 --> 22:33.120
I have something to say.

22:34.200 --> 22:37.240
Usually, I would not interfere
in your personal matters,

22:37.320 --> 22:40.280
but it is affecting your mood.

22:41.040 --> 22:42.280
And when that happens,

22:42.880 --> 22:44.680
it also affects our work.

22:44.760 --> 22:45.880
Stop beating around the bush!

22:48.960 --> 22:50.600
Mr. Zhao has moved on.

22:51.120 --> 22:52.400
This is your chance to make your move.

23:00.440 --> 23:02.400
You have never fallen for someone,
have you?

23:03.880 --> 23:04.800
It's none of your business.

23:07.240 --> 23:09.280
If you truly love someone,

23:09.360 --> 23:11.840
you will share in their feelings,
understand their joys and pains,

23:12.360 --> 23:15.200
worry about their struggles,
and wish for their happiness.

23:16.360 --> 23:19.040
As for whether you can be with them,

23:19.120 --> 23:20.400
that will not be something
you will need to worry about.

23:23.320 --> 23:24.400
You are not wrong.

23:25.400 --> 23:28.720
Ms. Ji must be having
a hard time right now.

23:29.960 --> 23:32.640
But she is no ordinary woman.

23:33.600 --> 23:35.960
She is strong and clear-headed.

23:36.040 --> 23:38.880
I am sure that she will be fine
in less than three days.

23:40.200 --> 23:42.360
She is just pretending to be strong.

23:42.880 --> 23:45.680
Walking alone, standing by oneself.

23:46.200 --> 23:47.360
Those who understand her
know that she is troubled,

23:47.440 --> 23:48.600
but others might just wonder
what she is thinking of.

23:48.680 --> 23:49.600
FROM CLASSIC OF POETRY,
ODES OF WANG, SORROW

23:52.720 --> 23:55.600
Mr. Yang, after keeping an eye
on the Niu residence for a few days,

23:55.680 --> 23:57.840
our men finally saw someone
go up the mountain

23:57.920 --> 23:59.920
to a secret cave in the dense forest.

24:00.000 --> 24:01.560
We can see signs of lit candles there.

24:03.880 --> 24:05.000
Finally, there is something.

24:05.600 --> 24:08.040
Maybe there are lookout guards
stationed there, just like last time.

24:08.120 --> 24:09.320
Lookout guards?

24:10.080 --> 24:11.560
There should not be lit candles then.

24:12.760 --> 24:13.880
Who went up to the mountain?

24:13.960 --> 24:17.200
It was Niu Wuniang's maid, Yu Yuan.

24:19.160 --> 24:20.520
That is unexpected.

24:21.320 --> 24:24.560
Niu Wuniang once used this maid
to stage an act before me

24:24.640 --> 24:26.240
to trap Chief Sang.

24:26.760 --> 24:28.240
Normally, someone like her

24:28.320 --> 24:31.960
would discard
such a pawn to avoid complications.

24:32.040 --> 24:34.760
Yet, she still trusts Yu Yuan enough
to send her up the mountain.

24:35.280 --> 24:38.200
That means that this maid must hold
some special importance to her.

24:39.320 --> 24:42.080
What is your plan?
Do you plan to make the maid talk?

24:46.120 --> 24:48.640
If someone ever captured you

24:49.240 --> 24:51.080
and asked why I came here
or what my purpose was,

24:51.680 --> 24:52.960
would you tell them?

24:53.040 --> 24:54.240
I would not, of course.

24:55.600 --> 24:56.640
But it is

24:57.840 --> 24:59.360
for my master's sake,

25:00.400 --> 25:01.560
not yours.

25:02.880 --> 25:03.760
It would be the same for her too.

25:05.440 --> 25:07.320
Continue keeping an eye on her.
I will head over later.

25:07.400 --> 25:08.280
Understood!

25:14.560 --> 25:16.120
So, what is your current plan now?

25:18.680 --> 25:20.120
I have not even dealt
with my personal matters yet.

25:21.560 --> 25:23.080
I cannot focus on work.

25:29.840 --> 25:32.000
We have some goji berries,
chrysanthemum petals,

25:32.080 --> 25:33.600
and boiled pig heart here.

25:34.120 --> 25:35.320
It is great for your liver,
improves your eyesight,

25:35.400 --> 25:36.320
and calms the mind.

25:36.400 --> 25:38.600
Okay. Okay. I got it.

25:39.680 --> 25:45.120
You are saying that I am a clueless idiot
who cannot see through a person clearly.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.440
I thought about it.

25:49.280 --> 25:51.480
He did not really do anything to wrong me.

25:53.840 --> 25:54.840
Here.

25:55.640 --> 25:57.160
You should have more of this.

25:57.760 --> 25:59.200
I am being serious.

26:01.840 --> 26:05.200
Since my family fell into hardship,
he has been there to help,

26:05.280 --> 26:07.040
never leaving us.

26:07.960 --> 26:10.680
Even my own relatives
could not have done what he did.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.040
He understands me,

26:13.920 --> 26:15.760
lets me be free,

26:16.320 --> 26:18.400
and never pressures me
to act like a proper lady.

26:20.040 --> 26:24.360
He even hides his talents for my sake,
enduring scorn from his family.

26:27.920 --> 26:29.560
But our paths

26:30.840 --> 26:32.120
have now diverged.

26:34.520 --> 26:36.360
He does not love power itself,

26:37.000 --> 26:40.120
but the stability and freedom
that it brings.

26:41.760 --> 26:45.120
As for me, I am on a different path.

26:46.840 --> 26:49.360
Then, find someone
who is on the same path as you.

26:54.200 --> 26:55.120
Forget about it.

26:56.360 --> 26:59.560
From now on, I will walk my own path.

27:00.080 --> 27:01.480
I do not need to have someone by my side.

27:03.960 --> 27:05.920
You still cannot let go of Zhao Xiuyuan.

27:10.760 --> 27:13.320
After all these years of knowing him,

27:14.000 --> 27:15.440
how could I just let go?

27:18.800 --> 27:22.080
But who says that not letting go
means that I cannot keep moving forward?

27:23.240 --> 27:25.840
With Blossom Society gaining fame
thanks to Flushed Rose,

27:26.440 --> 27:28.480
now is the perfect time
to strike while the iron is hot.

27:29.280 --> 27:31.920
I am thinking about what comes next.

27:32.520 --> 27:35.000
Dyeing silk is just
a small part of the business.

27:35.600 --> 27:37.720
- The real work is in weaving the brocade.
- Stop!

27:40.960 --> 27:42.480
He was right.

27:42.560 --> 27:44.880
Business is the best way to cure you!

27:45.920 --> 27:46.800
Who are you talking about?

28:01.520 --> 28:03.600
So, the person that Yu meant
is you, Mr. Yang.

28:04.640 --> 28:05.960
I heard that you were looking for me.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.640
What can I do for you?

28:14.120 --> 28:17.240
I have been feeling down lately

28:17.800 --> 28:19.840
and just need someone to talk to,

28:20.880 --> 28:23.640
to help clear my mind and lift my spirits.

28:24.440 --> 28:26.800
Then, you have got the wrong person,
Mr. Yang.

28:26.880 --> 28:29.360
I have matters to attend to.
I will take my leave.

28:31.120 --> 28:31.960
No, wait!

28:36.640 --> 28:38.240
Do you know where this is?

28:40.560 --> 28:41.880
I do not want to know.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.640
This place is called Wangyou Lake.

28:47.480 --> 28:49.720
Leave all your worries here,

28:49.800 --> 28:52.200
and they will sink to the bottom
of the lake, disappearing completely.

28:54.360 --> 28:55.240
Give it a try.

29:36.880 --> 29:40.840
WANGUAN

29:41.440 --> 29:42.360
For you.

30:07.760 --> 30:11.000
But giving up on you is my own choice.

30:18.640 --> 30:20.200
The floating lantern costs 30 wen.

30:23.880 --> 30:25.480
Thirty wen?

30:26.560 --> 30:28.520
That is expensive!
You are being ridiculous!

30:31.480 --> 30:34.360
I have bought floating lanterns before,
and they were only about two wen.

30:34.920 --> 30:36.440
This particular one
is called Luo Shen's Lantern.

30:36.520 --> 30:38.560
Rumor has it
that Luo Shen used it himself.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.080
Really?

30:42.200 --> 30:44.800
Just because it is named after someone,
the price skyrockets.

30:45.320 --> 30:46.880
Only an idiot would buy it.

30:47.760 --> 30:48.840
Come with me.

30:54.280 --> 30:56.640
This wine from my sister
is called Wen Jun's Wine.

30:57.320 --> 30:59.360
Are you saying that
anyone who drinks this wine

30:59.440 --> 31:01.200
is also an idiot?

31:05.440 --> 31:09.440
Whether it is Wen Jun's Wine
or Luo Shen's Lantern,

31:10.040 --> 31:11.440
it is just a fancy name.

31:11.520 --> 31:14.360
Yet everyone loves
to jump on the bandwagon.

31:16.040 --> 31:17.360
Ms. Ji,

31:18.200 --> 31:20.160
do you not want to join the fun too?

31:23.400 --> 31:24.560
I understand now!

31:25.280 --> 31:27.400
Can you tell me
about some famous people from Shu?

31:28.360 --> 31:31.280
I am not well-read, so I would not know.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.480
As someone who has traveled extensively,

31:34.560 --> 31:35.520
you must have
plenty of experiences to share,

31:35.600 --> 31:37.000
even if you have not read much.

31:38.120 --> 31:40.320
Worst case,
I will share some of my earnings with you.

31:47.080 --> 31:50.280
So dangerous, so high!

31:50.800 --> 31:53.040
The hardships of the Shu Road
Harder than…

31:54.640 --> 31:55.800
Get over here.

32:01.640 --> 32:02.480
Harder than…

32:02.560 --> 32:05.600
Ascending to the heavens above!

32:09.520 --> 32:11.400
The kings sought to open this land!

32:13.200 --> 32:15.640
Yet their efforts
Were shrouded in uncertainty!

32:15.720 --> 32:16.560
FROM LI BAI'S HARD ROADS TO SHU

32:24.640 --> 32:26.520
Forty-eight thousand years
Have passed since then!

32:32.760 --> 32:35.720
And not a soul has crossed these borders!

32:39.320 --> 32:41.320
To the west, at the mountain
Lies a bird's path!

32:42.040 --> 32:44.240
A daring passage
Spanning the peaks of hills!

32:46.520 --> 32:48.840
Only when the earth crumbled
And mountains fell!

32:55.080 --> 32:57.960
Did brave men carve ladders
And stone bridges!

33:00.120 --> 33:02.360
Above, towering peaks
Where six dragons turn to the sun!

33:03.680 --> 33:06.600
Below, waters clash
And twist through unruly rivers!

33:10.640 --> 33:12.680
Even the yellow crane
Cannot hope to fly past!

33:14.360 --> 33:18.680
And apes, though nimble, lament the climb!

33:18.760 --> 33:19.680
Careful!

33:27.600 --> 33:31.200
No matter how treacherous the Shu Road,
nothing can stop a determined spirit.

33:31.800 --> 33:34.600
I wish you success
in overcoming every challenge

33:35.120 --> 33:36.760
and a bright future ahead, Ms. Ji!

33:53.200 --> 33:55.200
- Yuniang? I…
- What?

33:57.320 --> 33:58.800
Yingying will not be returning
anytime soon.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.360
Do you want to vent her frustrations
on her behalf?

34:01.000 --> 34:02.000
What are we doing?

34:02.720 --> 34:05.120
Write something for me,
but use your left hand.

34:09.239 --> 34:10.520
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

34:10.600 --> 34:13.280
Will this cheer Yingying up?

34:14.560 --> 34:15.520
It might not.

34:16.520 --> 34:17.440
Let us go!

34:18.239 --> 34:19.159
Move!

34:20.760 --> 34:24.360
THE RESIDENCE OF COLDNESS AND EMPTINESS

34:24.440 --> 34:27.080
I am happy with what we have done.

34:27.840 --> 34:29.480
It is nice to see you happy.

34:29.560 --> 34:31.239
That makes everything
we have done worthwhile.

34:31.880 --> 34:32.880
Do not worry.

34:33.400 --> 34:36.639
Yingying has just lost someone
who was not right for her.

34:36.719 --> 34:39.719
It is natural to feel sad,
but she will not die from it,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.280
and she will not mourn forever.

34:43.560 --> 34:48.120
You… Have you ever felt
the same kind of sadness as Yingying?

34:48.199 --> 34:49.920
That is a rather
an inappropriate question.

34:50.000 --> 34:51.159
You should focus on earning money

34:51.239 --> 34:52.800
and mind your own business,
not other people's.

34:57.240 --> 34:58.920
But this is my business.

35:00.560 --> 35:01.920
And I care about you.

35:09.400 --> 35:11.120
Yang Jinglan!

35:20.520 --> 35:21.520
Keep it down.

35:23.120 --> 35:25.840
Guo Kui, if you wake my mother,
I will break your legs!

35:27.920 --> 35:29.400
Guo Kui, tell me,

35:29.920 --> 35:31.480
when will I be able

35:31.560 --> 35:34.080
to walk through your front door openly
instead of sneaking in like this?

35:36.640 --> 35:38.480
Guo Kui, remember,

35:38.560 --> 35:40.560
whether it is through the wall
or the front gate,

35:40.640 --> 35:41.760
no upright man

35:41.840 --> 35:44.560
would visit a young maiden's house
before she is married,

35:44.640 --> 35:46.160
as it only invites gossip.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.280
Ms. Ji,

35:51.000 --> 35:52.000
what are you doing?

35:52.080 --> 35:54.720
Are you trying to keep me here

35:55.960 --> 35:56.800
for longer?

35:57.960 --> 36:00.160
It is because you enjoy
flying around, Mr. Yang.

36:00.240 --> 36:01.560
So, there is no need for you
to use the door.

36:02.320 --> 36:03.640
Or… would you prefer to go through there?

36:09.480 --> 36:10.960
I would prefer using this one.

36:12.040 --> 36:14.800
Well, thank you for your advice, Ms. Ji.

36:15.320 --> 36:17.160
I will get back to my own affairs now.

36:20.800 --> 36:22.920
Thank you for your comfort, Mr. Yang.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.680
One more thing…

36:32.920 --> 36:33.920
Rest well.

37:16.760 --> 37:17.640
Oh no!

38:00.160 --> 38:01.400
By tomorrow, news will spread that

38:01.480 --> 38:04.880
the fourth brocade officer
in Yizhou has died.

38:05.680 --> 38:07.640
The entire city will be in a panic,

38:07.720 --> 38:09.400
and the court will send inspectors.

38:10.080 --> 38:11.960
I bet that this is not
the outcome you want.

38:15.280 --> 38:18.120
Let us talk then.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.320
Zhuge is here too.

38:36.680 --> 38:37.960
He did not reveal anything, did he?

38:40.440 --> 38:42.120
You are too good at fighting, Mr. Yang.

38:42.840 --> 38:47.000
If I had not brought enough people,
you probably would have escaped.

38:49.200 --> 38:53.720
Now that things have come to this,
let us speak openly.

38:55.040 --> 38:57.160
You should know that you will not be

38:57.240 --> 38:58.840
the only brocade officer
buried on Mount Qingcheng.

39:00.080 --> 39:01.920
What is the point of that threat,
Niu Wuniang?

39:13.520 --> 39:14.480
This is…?

39:15.680 --> 39:18.520
I know that you are being sent
by the court to investigate Shu Red Silk.

39:19.600 --> 39:21.680
Now that you have them before you,

39:21.760 --> 39:24.240
you can use them
to report back to the court, Mr. Yang.

39:31.200 --> 39:33.200
Shu Red Silk has been missing
for a long time.

39:33.280 --> 39:35.840
Where did you find it, Niu Wuniang?

39:37.160 --> 39:38.480
It is better

39:39.680 --> 39:41.160
if you do not know.

39:43.280 --> 39:47.760
Since you have shown me such sincerity,
I will speak frankly as well.

39:48.920 --> 39:51.480
I came to Yizhou
solely in pursuit of fame and wealth.

39:51.560 --> 39:53.840
Any offenses I committed before
were unintentional.

39:54.360 --> 39:55.520
If you are willing to take me in,

39:55.600 --> 40:00.080
I am ready to serve you faithfully
and follow your every command.

40:01.800 --> 40:04.120
Look at him. Zhuge is really excited!

40:04.920 --> 40:08.240
He has been wanting to achieve
something great in his lifetime.

40:09.160 --> 40:10.080
Zhuge,

40:10.600 --> 40:14.640
now that we have Niu Wuniang
and General Niu's support,

40:14.720 --> 40:17.640
it will be easier
to achieve something great, will it not?

40:22.120 --> 40:25.400
I knew that you would be easy to convince.

40:30.560 --> 40:32.960
I have already prepared
the documents for you.

40:33.040 --> 40:34.200
As for the official seal,

40:34.280 --> 40:35.880
your official seal,

40:35.960 --> 40:37.120
I will leave that to you.

40:37.880 --> 40:41.360
All that is needed is for you
to send the Shu Red Silk to Chang'an.

40:41.960 --> 40:43.320
From now on,

40:43.400 --> 40:46.920
we will share the wealth
and success equally.

41:08.960 --> 41:10.320
Protect, Ms. Niu!

41:16.400 --> 41:18.080
What is that for, Mr. Yang?

41:18.160 --> 41:19.800
Your people have wronged mine.

41:19.880 --> 41:21.240
If I do not take action,

41:21.320 --> 41:24.400
how will my people
ever respect me in the future?

41:24.480 --> 41:26.640
YANG JINGLAN

41:31.720 --> 41:34.480
You are someone of strong character,
Mr. Yang.

41:35.200 --> 41:37.920
Those who do not have a temper
are the most frightening, are they not?

41:39.040 --> 41:41.320
Before the Shu Red Silk
is sent to Chang'an,

41:41.400 --> 41:43.800
it still needs to be verified
at the Brocade Bureau,

41:44.320 --> 41:45.240
Niu Wuniang.

41:45.320 --> 41:48.800
How about I take a thread with me,
just for the sake of formality?

41:49.480 --> 41:50.440
As you please.

41:52.400 --> 41:54.760
But I must add one more thing.

41:55.680 --> 41:56.840
Tomorrow, the silk

41:56.920 --> 41:59.640
will be sent to Chang'an
along with your certified documents.

42:00.920 --> 42:03.320
If anything goes wrong after that,

42:03.400 --> 42:06.880
you will be held responsible, not me.

42:08.600 --> 42:10.480
Do not worry, Niu Wuniang.

42:22.200 --> 42:26.400
Ms. Niu,
can Yang Jinglan truly be trusted?

42:28.400 --> 42:30.080
I do not trust him, of course.

42:32.240 --> 42:34.520
But he was right about one thing.

42:35.720 --> 42:37.360
Unless absolutely necessary,

42:37.440 --> 42:40.880
we cannot allow
another brocade officer to die in Yizhou.

42:43.800 --> 42:47.320
Whether his cooperation is sincere
or just a facade,

42:48.960 --> 42:51.840
we are all in the same boat now.

42:52.920 --> 42:54.280
If it sinks,

42:54.840 --> 42:56.520
none of us will survive.
